The measured results in nachweis/ are derived from open data of the Fermi Gamma-ray Burst Monitor (GBM),
retrieved from the High Energy Astrophysics Science Archive Research Center (HEASARC), NASA Goddard Space Flight
Center: https://heasarc.gsfc.nasa.gov/FTP/fermi/data/gbm/daily/ (CTIME and position history files) and the
HEASARC tables fermigtrig and fermigbrst (TAP service https://heasarc.gsfc.nasa.gov/xamin/vo/tap).
GBM data have not been proprietary at any time during the mission (Fermi Science Support Center, Fermi Data Policy);
"HEASARC materials are all available freely for your use" (HEASARC, Use of HEASARC Data).

This research has made use of data and/or software provided by the High Energy Astrophysics Science Archive
Research Center (HEASARC), which is a service of the Astrophysics Science Division at NASA/GSFC.

Raw data are not part of this repository; `gbmtransient holen` downloads them.
